    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/97a9e5cb8d9071095847a1b9e81bc79e.avif?t=1696321649\" /></div><br>Hercules and Megara peacefully sailed on the ship enjoying the sun and breeze when a strange glowing bottle appeared on the sea surface. Within it lied a message: a desperate call for help. Who could send it? And what happened to this person? Our heroic couple goes in search of answers immediately!<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/74e0ad5e0e1e2cd03f03cf9e14276cc3.avif?t=1696321649\" /></div><br><br>Soon they found a sick, old man sitting on the beach. Hercules barely recognized him as Poseidon! Somebody stole the Sea Master\u2019s divine strength\u2026 But who is cunning enough to do this?  And what else is he or she capable of? <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/d121dae433ca7f13d56da6ad64227fca.avif?t=1696321649\" /></div><br><br>Hercules has to sort things out, find the villain, save Olympian gods and the whole world\u2026 again! Join his fascinating marine investigation in \u201c12 Labours of Hercules XIV: Message in a Bottle\u201d! Yo-ho-ho!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/64976a87fe6063c35a0698d79cdb2445.avif?t=1696321649\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Accompany Hercules with a new Game Speed setting!<br></li><li>Explore sublevels, bonus levels, super bonus levels and extra super-bonus levels!<br></li><li>Interactive guide<br></li><li>Wallpapers<br></li><li>Additional bonus levels<br></li><li>Hercules saving gods</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/6fcece2b0a1bc00cb7c8c14d95b0af9e.avif?t=1696321649\" /></div><br><br><strong>Come and play our latest VR game! </strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/97a9e5cb8d9071095847a1b9e81bc79e.avif?t=1696321649\" /></div><br>Hercules and Megara peacefully sailed on the ship enjoying the sun and breeze when a strange glowing bottle appeared on the sea surface. Within it lied a message: a desperate call for help. Who could send it? And what happened to this person? Our heroic couple goes in search of answers immediately!<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/74e0ad5e0e1e2cd03f03cf9e14276cc3.avif?t=1696321649\" /></div><br><br>Soon they found a sick, old man sitting on the beach. Hercules barely recognized him as Poseidon! Somebody stole the Sea Master\u2019s divine strength\u2026 But who is cunning enough to do this?  And what else is he or she capable of? <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/d121dae433ca7f13d56da6ad64227fca.avif?t=1696321649\" /></div><br><br>Hercules has to sort things out, find the villain, save Olympian gods and the whole world\u2026 again! Join his fascinating marine investigation in \u201c12 Labours of Hercules XIV: Message in a Bottle\u201d! Yo-ho-ho!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/64976a87fe6063c35a0698d79cdb2445.avif?t=1696321649\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Accompany Hercules with a new Game Speed setting!<br></li><li>Explore sublevels, bonus levels, super bonus levels and extra super-bonus levels!<br></li><li>Interactive guide<br></li><li>Wallpapers<br></li><li>Additional bonus levels<br></li><li>Hercules saving gods</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/6fcece2b0a1bc00cb7c8c14d95b0af9e.avif?t=1696321649\" /></div><br><br><strong>Come and play our latest VR game! </strong>",
